# Udev rule for Robotiq gripper using FTDI USB-to-serial converter (vendor 0403, product 6015)
# - Sets device permissions to 0666 (read/write for all users)
# - Creates a symlink /dev/robotiq for easy access
# - Adds uaccess tag for user-space device access
SUBSYSTEM=="tty", ATTRS{idVendor}=="0403", ATTRS{idProduct}=="6015", \
  MODE="0666", SYMLINK+="robotiq", TAG+="uaccess"
